9. Improved Patient Comfort: CAM can be used to improve patients' quality of life by providing them with alternative methods to improve their physical and emotional wellstanding.

10. Compliance to Treatment: CAM can help improve patient compliance to traditional healthcare treatments by reducing side effects and improving overall comfort.

