The chemical name of **cyclamate** is **potassium sodium cyclamate (KNaC₆H₅N₂O₃)**, with the free acid being **cycloxanthone-1-carboxylic acid (1,2-dioxazolidheno[1,2-a]quinoline-3,4-dicarboxylic acid)**.
