   \[
   262.5 \text{ m} \times \text{width} = 825 \text{ m}^2
   \]
   \[
   \text{width} = \frac{825 \text{ m}^2}{262.5 \text{ m}} = 3.15 \text{ m}
   \]

   The width of each paving stone is \(\boxed{3.15 \text{ m}}\).
