\[
c = \frac{2b\sin B - a\sqrt{2}}{\sin C}.
\]
Substituting this into the area formula:
\[
3 = \frac{1}{2}ab \sin C = \frac{1}{2}ab \sin C \left( \frac{2b\sin B - a\sqrt{2}}{\sin C} \right) = ab(b\sin B - \sqrt{2}a/2).
