   The new closed-loop gain is:  
   \[
   A_{vf}' = \frac{A_v'}{1 + m_v A_v'} = \frac{80}{1 + 0.1 \times 80} = \frac{80}{9} \approx 8.89
   \]

4. **Percentage Change**:  
   The percentage change is:  
   \[
   \text{Percentage Change} = \left( \frac{A_{vf}' - A_{vf}}{A_{vf}} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{8.89 - 9.09}{9.09} \right) \times 100 \approx -2.29\%
   \]

   The negative sign indicates a decrease in the closed-loop gain.

