\]

Setting \( q_g = q_a \), we get:

\[
\frac{1.65 \sqrt{\mu_g \mu_g / \mu_w}}{x^{0.25} \sqrt{T_g / T_w}} (T_g - T_w) = \frac{1.65 \sqrt{\mu_a \mu_a / \mu_w}}{x^{0.25} \sqrt{T_a / T_w}} (T_a - T_w)
\]

Simplifying, we get:

\[
\sqrt{\frac{\mu_g \mu_g}{T_g}} (T_g - T_w) = \sqrt{\frac{\mu_a \mu_a}{T_a}} (T_a - T_w)
\]

