","To estimate the weight of the body, we equate the force of gravity (weight) to the force due to the pressure difference between the inlet and the upper edge of the cone. The force due to the pressure difference is given by the pressure multiplied by the projected area of the cone at the upper edge.

1. **Calculate the volumetric flow rate (Q):**
   \[
